// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P3976169646" "Good to see you, {HeroName}. We've got some major problems in the sewers beneath Atlas and we could use your help. Longbow is stretched thin due to the Galaxy City incident.<br><br>There are several villain groups who have made the sewers their home. That much isn't new. However, what <i>is</i> new is the emergence of creatures called the <color yellow>Hydra</color>. Before, they were contained within the deepest part of the sewers, but we have word that these monsters have moved up.<br><br>We need heroes such as yourself to go down there and destroy those Hydra, or else they could cause the entire city to collapse on itself!<br><br><color orange>To access the trial, Death from Below, click on the LFG tab on your chat window, then select the appropriate trial to enter into a queue to join it. The trial can be started with as few as 4 people and as many as 8 people.<br><br>Players who complete the trial will receive a bonus to their overall damage, defense, accuracy, or recovery for a week or until they reach level 22."
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P459988271" "{HeroName}, we could use your help with some problems we have in the sewers."
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// DisplayName for N_SewerTrialInfo :
"P4277719174" "Longbow Sewer Inspector"

