// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P2861857135" "Arachnos has discovered that the heroes of Atlas Park have a little situation on their hands. There are creatures called the <color yellow>Hydra</color> who are making their way up the sewer system. Normally, we would simply let them destroy any parts of Paragon City that they can. However, Arachnos is interested in salvaging the powers of these Hydra.<br><br>We believe their chemicals can be useful in increasing the powers of those exposed to it, which is why you and I are currently speaking. Arachnos can help you and a team of cohorts get into the sewers of Atlas. All you have to do is make your way down to the bottom and destroy the Hydra. From there, we will recover their chemicals and give you all several samples to increase your own powers, to use against the heroes of Paragon, of course.<br><br><color orange>To access the trial, Death from Below, click on the LFG tab on your chat window, then select the appropriate trial to enter into a queue to join it. The trial can be started with as few as 4 people and as many as 8 people.<br><br>Players who complete the trial will receive a bonus to their overall damage, defense, accuracy, or recovery for a week or until they reach level 22."
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P935041541" "{HeroName}, Arachnos is looking for aid in taking advantage of Atlas. Interested?"
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_SewerTrialInfo :
"P952703501" "Arachnos Scout"
